      "text": "Echo usually comes from hard surfaces. Record in a room with soft things, like a bedroom with carpet and curtains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 18.3,
      "end": 23.19,
      "text": "Kitchens are the worst for echo, lots of hard surfaces. Even moving to the living room would help."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 26.47,
      "end": 32.969,
      "text": "Hang blankets around you, or put pillows on the table. Also get closer to the mic, so it picks up more of you and less of the room."
